# Optional. Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the browser bundle,
# so no key or other secret may ever go here. The LLM key belongs in the root
# .env, which only the backend reads.

# Where the API lives. The default /api/v1 goes through the dev proxy in
# vite.config.ts; set this only when the frontend is served separately.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
